Lprogram is executed or compiled with a
	/ slash B option (compile for batch) BCOMP will not allocate
	/ more than 5 fields (24kw).  The reason for this is that batch
	/ requires 4k, and if the system has 32kw of memory field 7 is
	/ allocated for the TD ROM option.  The following conditional will
	/ correct this restriction.

	TDCHK=0		/ 0 = do not check for TD ROM option
	
